@startuml kairos-forgot-reset-password-sequence
title Forgot and Reset Password

actor User
participant "Member App" as MemberApp
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "Auth Provider" as Auth
participant "Messaging" as Messaging

User -> MemberApp: Click "Forgot password"
MemberApp -> API: POST /auth/forgot-password {email}
API -> Auth: Generate reset token
Auth --> API: resetToken
API -> Messaging: Send reset email with link
Messaging --> API: Accepted
API --> MemberApp: 200 OK

' Later, from email link
User -> MemberApp: Open reset link\nEnter new password
MemberApp -> API: POST /auth/reset-password {token,newPassword}
API -> Auth: Reset password with token
Auth --> API: OK
API --> MemberApp: 200 OK

MemberApp --> User: Show "Password reset successful" + link to Login

@enduml
